{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sneak past the undead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/f215b1908287563a9b82eda91a8c85ef.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/f215b1908287563a9b82eda91a8c85ef.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/f215b1908287563a9b82eda91a8c85ef.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The dead have risen from their graves and haunt this crypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move past them without being seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teleport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/3ecd4804f40f7d320f0c1499fc883b33.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/3ecd4804f40f7d320f0c1499fc883b33.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/3ecd4804f40f7d320f0c1499fc883b33.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can't always just walk past the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a teleport ahead of time and then teleport back to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't get caught!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/418c214e0043e91451ed7181fc9ed487.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/418c214e0043e91451ed7181fc9ed487.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/418c214e0043e91451ed7181fc9ed487.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You're defenseless. Your only weapon is your wits and the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/21120fe7fce0dad87c780f07dd7d90e4.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/21120fe7fce0dad87c780f07dd7d90e4.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/21120fe7fce0dad87c780f07dd7d90e4.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dark Crypt is turn-based, you can take your time to plan and execute the moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dark Crypt?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based puzzler with a teleporting mechanic about sneaking through an ancient crypt, while avoiding its traps and the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prophecy speaks of an ancient evil that slumbers within a crypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It foretells its awakening which will lead to our world being consumed by its dark shadow. Your brothers at the monastery dismiss it as a pagan heresy, however you know better than that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's fate rests on your shoulders. It's up to you to find the slumbering evil and seal it, before it awakens. Can you save our world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 challenging levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking with teleports </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite undos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeletons, Vampires, Spikes and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-rendition of chill-inducing classical music </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Interventor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/831a7e0895590acf21039a44594d4bb61f72f106.jpg"},{"name":"Dedicatio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/83a1a5961c1961ceb4fd542ef01075aabe032692.jpg"},{"name":"Fidem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/818b6928c70a8c407c58781bce7a4f7680e8bb69.jpg"},{"name":"Memoriae","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/ff105c772cf2ae6ad189b508c2b4eeb52c4d1f95.jpg"},{"name":"Sanitas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/356bdc66eda0d264c8085052168d386687283715.jpg"},{"name":"Renovamen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/85a2ce1832e98f32ebc700549689ef39085d7c11.jpg"},{"name":"Aemulator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/1302071f9f55504bc0d9cc39c90f22a702cb8a92.jpg"},{"name":"Sapientia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1706170/6acf60095b42bae1396d02055944e8903705a646.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1706170?t=1757579208","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1706170?t=1757579208","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757579208","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757579208","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>MY NEW GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sneak past the undead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/f215b1908287563a9b82eda91a8c85ef.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/f215b1908287563a9b82eda91a8c85ef.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/f215b1908287563a9b82eda91a8c85ef.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The dead have risen from their graves and haunt this crypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move past them without being seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teleport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/3ecd4804f40f7d320f0c1499fc883b33.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/3ecd4804f40f7d320f0c1499fc883b33.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/3ecd4804f40f7d320f0c1499fc883b33.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You can't always just walk past the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a teleport ahead of time and then teleport back to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't get caught!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/418c214e0043e91451ed7181fc9ed487.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/418c214e0043e91451ed7181fc9ed487.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/418c214e0043e91451ed7181fc9ed487.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You're defenseless. Your only weapon is your wits and the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan your moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/21120fe7fce0dad87c780f07dd7d90e4.poster.avif?t=1757579208\" width=332 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/21120fe7fce0dad87c780f07dd7d90e4.webm?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/extras/21120fe7fce0dad87c780f07dd7d90e4.mp4?t=1757579208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dark Crypt is turn-based, you can take your time to plan and execute the moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Dark Crypt?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A turn-based puzzler with a teleporting mechanic about sneaking through an ancient crypt, while avoiding its traps and the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prophecy speaks of an ancient evil that slumbers within a crypt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It foretells its awakening which will lead to our world being consumed by its dark shadow. Your brothers at the monastery dismiss it as a pagan heresy, however you know better than that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's fate rests on your shoulders. It's up to you to find the slumbering evil and seal it, before it awakens. Can you save our world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 challenging levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking with teleports </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite undos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeletons, Vampires, Spikes and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-rendition of chill-inducing classical music </p></li></ul>","developers":["Daisy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1706170/header.jpg?t=1757579208","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any distribution<br